Replaces inconsistent `window.confirm()` and `alert()` patterns across admin UI with accessible, reusable components. Standardizes API base URL to `/api/v1` with enhanced auth/error interceptors.

## Components Added

**`ConfirmModal`** - Accessible confirmation dialog
- ARIA attributes (role="dialog", aria-modal, aria-labelledby)
- Focus trap with Tab/Shift+Tab cycling
- ESC key and backdrop close
- Optional text confirmation for critical actions

**`LoadingButton`** - Async action button with visual feedback
- Spinner animation during loading
- Auto-disable to prevent double-submission
- aria-busy for screen readers

**`ToastProvider`** - Toast notification system
- Success/error/info/warning types with auto-dismiss
- aria-live region for accessibility
- Replaces all `alert()` calls

**`errorHandler`** utility - Centralized error mapping
- Maps HTTP status codes to user-friendly messages
- Consistent error UX across pages

## API Standardization

**Before:**
```jsx
const response = await fetch(`${import.meta.env.VITE_API_URL}/admin/logs/export`);
```

**After:**
```jsx
import API from '../utils/api';
const response = await API.get('/admin/logs/export');
// Base URL automatically set to /api/v1
// Auth token automatically included
// 401 errors auto-redirect to login
```

## Usage Pattern

**Before:**
```jsx
const handleDelete = async (id) => {
  if (!window.confirm('Are you sure?')) return;
  try {
    await API.delete(`/users/${id}`);
    alert('Success!');
  } catch (err) {
    console.error(err);
    alert('Failed!');
  }
};
```

**After:**
```jsx
import { ConfirmModal, LoadingButton } from '../components/ui';
import { useToast } from '../components/ui/ToastProvider';
import { handleError } from '../utils/errorHandler';

const [modalOpen, setModalOpen] = useState(false);
const [deleting, setDeleting] = useState(false);
const { toast } = useToast();

const handleDeleteConfirm = async () => {
  setDeleting(true);
  try {
    await API.delete(`/users/${id}`);
    toast.success('User deleted');
  } catch (err) {
    toast.error(handleError(err, 'deleting user').userMessage);
  } finally {
    setDeleting(false);
  }
};
```

## Pages Updated

- **ActivityLogs** - Export with endpoint auto-detection, client-side CSV fallback for >5000 rows
- **AuditLogViewer** - Endpoint detection with localStorage caching, export functionality
- **Users** - ConfirmModal for delete, proper 403 permission handling
- **BlogManager** - ConfirmModal for delete/publish actions
- **MediaManager** - ConfirmModal for delete, pagination bounds fixed

## Additional Fixes

- Pagination: Prev/Next properly disabled at boundaries (page ≤ 1, page ≥ totalPages)
- All inline buttons have `type="button"` to prevent form submission
- API interceptors: AuthContext token → localStorage fallback, 401 auto-redirect
- Accessibility: WCAG 2.1 Level AA compliance (focus trap, keyboard nav, screen reader support)

## Bundle Impact

+6KB gzipped total. No breaking changes - backward compatible with existing pages.

## Documentation

- `docs/CHANGES_ADMIN_UI.md` - Detailed changelog with migration guide
- `PR_SUMMARY.md` - Component API reference and usage examples

